1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,668
A shopper can love a fashion brand,

2
00:00:05,668 --> 00:00:07,238
admire the photography,

3
00:00:07,238 --> 00:00:10,126
and still hesitate at the most important moment.

4
00:00:10,501 --> 00:00:12,490
Deciding whether to buy.

5
00:00:12,490 --> 00:00:13,463
Online,

6
00:00:13,463 --> 00:00:15,368
customers don't get the fitting room.

7
00:00:15,368 --> 00:00:18,544
They can't easily imagine how a garment will look on them.

8
00:00:18,544 --> 00:00:23,143
And when they have a question about sizing, delivery, or the product
itself,

9
00:00:23,143 --> 00:00:24,865
they need a clear answer.

10
00:00:24,865 --> 00:00:26,859
Not another reason to leave.

11
00:00:30,359 --> 00:00:33,623
For fashion brands, this creates a challenge that goes far

12
00:00:33,623 --> 00:00:36,101
beyond building a beautiful website.

13
00:00:36,101 --> 00:00:39,589
The experience has to help people explore with confidence,

14
00:00:39,956 --> 00:00:41,650
and it has to feel personal,

15
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:43,319
even when the store is busy.

16
00:00:43,319 --> 00:00:45,864
That's the thinking behind GRINDCTRL.

17
00:00:49,364 --> 00:00:54,801
GRINDCTRL brings practical AI experiences into Shopify fashion stores.

18
00:00:54,801 --> 00:00:59,333
It connects product discovery with helpful store-specific conversations.

19
00:00:59,333 --> 00:01:02,807
Giving shoppers better ways to explore what they're considering.

20
00:01:02,807 --> 00:01:06,672
Instead of treating shopping as a series of disconnected clicks,

21
00:01:06,672 --> 00:01:07,882
the goal is to make

22
00:01:07,882 --> 00:01:09,664
each step more useful.

23
00:01:09,664 --> 00:01:11,297
A shopper sees a product.

24
00:01:11,630 --> 00:01:13,813
They want to picture it on themselves.

25
00:01:13,813 --> 00:01:15,045
They have a question.

26
00:01:15,045 --> 00:01:18,407
They want an answer that actually relates to that store.

27
00:01:21,907 --> 00:01:27,245
The virtual try-on experience helps them visualize a selected garment
using a photo.

28
00:01:27,245 --> 00:01:31,889
Store Chat helps answer questions using information supplied by the
merchant,

29
00:01:31,889 --> 00:01:34,924
with a route to the team when a human response is needed.

30
00:01:34,924 --> 00:01:36,486
And this is important.

31
00:01:36,486 --> 00:01:41,285
The AI is not meant to invent product details or replace a brand's
judgment.

32
00:01:41,285 --> 00:01:44,708
Its answers depend on the information the store provides,

33
00:01:44,708 --> 00:01:47,523
and more complex cases can move to a person.

34
00:01:51,023 --> 00:01:52,128
For merchants,

35
00:01:52,128 --> 00:01:56,681
the value is a more connected way to present products and support
shoppers.

36
00:01:56,681 --> 00:02:00,810
For customers, it's a shopping journey that feels easier to understand.

37
00:02:00,810 --> 00:02:04,381
You can explore the experience in the live demonstration store,

38
00:02:04,381 --> 00:02:06,003
see the features in action,

39
00:02:06,003 --> 00:02:08,939
and discuss how they fit your own Shopify setup.

40
00:02:12,439 --> 00:02:16,860
Because great online fashion should do more than display products
beautifully.

41
00:02:16,860 --> 00:02:19,701
It should help people make sense of what they're buying.

42
00:02:19,701 --> 00:02:23,320
Discover GRINDCTRL at grindctrl.cloud.
